### Verdict

**PASS WITH WARNINGS**

Implementation is functional for the primary use case (full view dropdowns respond to scroll, volume responds to scroll, toggle works). However, it has 1 critical bug in the compact panel (scroll repeats every frame due to un-zeroed gfx.mouse_wheel), 3 warning-level issues (inverted scroll direction from spec, missing delta consumption, missing active visual state on icon), and 5/10 spec scenarios are only partially compliant. Recommend fixing the critical compact-panel issue before merging.
